---
import macOsIconUrl from "../assets/icons8-mac-os.svg?url";
import googlePlayIconUrl from "../assets/icons8-google-play.svg?url";
---

<section class="py-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto bg-primary-gradient rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-white rounded-full -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 blur-3xl"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-white rounded-full translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 blur-3xl"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10 p-12 md:p-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-12">
            <div class="text-white md:max-w-lg">
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">Tu próximo viaje compartido está en tu bolsillo</h2>
                <p class="text-white/80 text-lg mb-10 font-medium">Descarga Trayko y encuentra compañeros de viaje en segundos. Publica tu ruta, coordina con pasajeros y ahorra en cada trayecto.</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                    <a class="bg-black text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3 hover:scale-105 transition-transform" href="#">
                        <img
                            src={macOsIconUrl}
                            alt=""
                            class="w-8 h-8"
                            loading="lazy"
                            decoding="async"
                        />
                        <div class="text-left">
                            <p class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold leading-none">Descargar en</p>
                            <p class="text-lg font-bold leading-none">App Store</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    <a class="bg-black text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3 hover:scale-105 transition-transform" href="#">
                        <img
                            src={googlePlayIconUrl}
                            alt=""
                            class="w-8 h-8"
                            loading="lazy"
                            decoding="async"
                        />
                        <div class="text-left">
                            <p class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold leading-none">Disponible en</p>
                            <p class="text-lg font-bold leading-none">Google Play</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden md:block relative">
                <div class="relative w-[320px] lg:w-[360px] xl:w-[360px] shrink-0 overflow-visible">
                    <img
                        src="/phone.png"
                        alt="Pantalla de la app Trayko"
                        class="w-full h-auto drop-shadow-2xl select-none will-change-transform scale-[1.75] lg:scale-[1.95] xl:scale-[2.1] origin-center"
                        loading="lazy"
                        decoding="async"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
